<title>USA: PHLX to trade Hvide Marine options Feb 3.</title>
<headline>PHLX to trade Hvide Marine options Feb 3.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philadelphia Stock Exchange (PHLX) said Wednesday it would begin trading options on Hvide Marine Inc on February 3.</p>
<p>The exchange said Hvide options would have opening strike prices of 22-1/2, 25 and 30, with expirations in February, March, June and September. Position limits have been set at 7,500 contracts.</p>
<p>Gateway Partners has been named specialist for the options.</p>
<p>Hvide shares ended Wednesday down 7/16 at 25-1/16. ((Derivatives desk, 3124088750/Email: derivatives@reuters.com))</p>
